msgid "Managed Localization Platforms vs. Local CI Automation (ADR)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/localization_platforms.md:3
#: 8f4211be8654499aa8068351e2284dbb
msgid ""
"As `findfmt` scales localization coverage across Tier 1 through Tier 4 "
"languages (see [Multi-Language Localization Architecture & Phased Rollout"
" Plan](localization_plan.md) and [Open-Source Python AI Translation "
"Benchmark & Architecture](ai_translation_benchmark.md)), this document "
"evaluates managed cloud localization platforms with native AI assistants "
"(**POEditor**, **Crowdin**, and **Localazy**) against `findfmt`'s self-"
"hosted CLI pipeline (`tools/i18n.py translate`) and records our "
"Architecture Decision Record (ADR)."
