#: ../../source/guides/localization_platforms.md:29
#: 486af448d6ef460f947a13d01b26f53b
#, python-brace-format, python-format
msgid ""
"**Rich Markup & CLI Flag Invariants:** Managed platforms natively "
"understand `%s` and `{name}` placeholders when `#, python-format` or `#, "
"python-brace-format` flags are present, but none natively parse Rich "
"console markup (`[bold]`, `[cyan]`, `[/]`) out of the box. In contrast, "
"`tools/i18n_validation.py` and `tools/i18n_prompts.py` enforce exact "
"parity for `{brace}` placeholders, `%s` tokens, Rich markup tags, and "
"`--cli-flags` before any `msgstr` is written to disk."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/localization_platforms.md:35
#: 9b2a2cb4387a4c7fa175c79bd531b64e
msgid ""
"**Header & Diff Hygiene:** Cloud platforms regenerate `.po` files on "
"export using their own serializers, which frequently alters header "
"ordering, line wrapping, or `#:` source comment formatting. `findfmt`'s "
"pre-commit hooks (`i18n-validate` and `check-no-absolute-locale-paths`) "
"require deterministic `babel`/`polib` formatting with workspace-relative "
"paths."
msgstr ""

