#: ../../source/guides/localization_platforms.md:57
#: 449fcc3faae84e159778c4c102f7e082
msgid "3. Contributor Auditing & Community Review Workflows"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/localization_platforms.md:59
#: 20b2db354acb49a5a49479db52ea1ad7
msgid ""
"As `findfmt` expands across 100+ locales, native-speaker community "
"contributors need a clear path to audit, correct, and approve AI-"
"generated translations:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/localization_platforms.md:62
#: bf4d7ac02af64625b41f387250c6eaca
msgid "Managed Cloud Platform Workflow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/localization_platforms.md:64
#: 3d9017c27e34496794d6c0d8fd4d2b78
msgid ""
"**Strengths:** Non-technical translators can log into a web UI, filter by"
" `fuzzy` or unapproved strings, view side-by-side translation memory "
"suggestions, vote on alternatives, and leave per-string comments without "
"installing Git or Python."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/localization_platforms.md:67
#: 2953ef22c6bb4505bd43e78647830ee6
msgid "**Drawbacks:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/localization_platforms.md:68
#: 5a81dc02a417451dbac1c60c914bcf47
msgid ""
"Introduces dual sources of truth (Git PRs vs. cloud platform state), "
"creating merge conflicts when developers run `uv run python tools/i18n.py"
" extract` and update `.pot`/`.po` catalogs in feature branches."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/localization_platforms.md:71
#: 996b22c5ed7f48aaad40b4655fbcb537
msgid ""
"Cloud exports can bypass local pre-commit checks until a sync PR fails in"
" CI, requiring manual maintainer intervention to fix broken Rich tags or "
"CLI flags."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/localization_platforms.md:74
#: a8c1aa66e0dd46aeb7e395d9e954d13e
msgid "Local Git + CI Auditing Workflow (`findfmt` Standard)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/localization_platforms.md:76
#: 5453b9b1467b47599f94d419d733be6a
msgid "**Strengths:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/localization_platforms.md:77
#: 33e5d6e2722b47a0a78ba52760b7add3
msgid ""
"AI-generated translations produced by `tools/i18n.py translate` can be "
"marked with the standard GNU `gettext` `fuzzy` flag (`--mark-fuzzy`) or "
"reviewed directly as clean `.po` diffs in GitHub Pull Requests."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/localization_platforms.md:80
#: 75b65bc3a54c45459ffdb92e8a873d4d
msgid ""
"Native speakers can edit `.po` files directly in the GitHub Web Editor "
"(`github.dev`), Poedit desktop, or any text editor and submit a standard "
"Pull Request."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/localization_platforms.md:82
#: 6c1954a8e67a4ab6a7e40b2911d95443
msgid ""
"Every contribution is automatically audited in CI by `uv run python "
"tools/i18n.py validate` and `msgfmt --check`, guaranteeing zero broken "
"placeholders, Rich tags, or plural forms."
msgstr ""

