#: ../../source/guides/localization_platforms.md:93
#: c89a6c7840f14a6a8f9c22ce6c5fdf66
msgid "Context"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/localization_platforms.md:95
#: b8b67b11e90d42d2bda8f4ab5fbcb94c
#, python-brace-format, python-format
msgid ""
"`findfmt` maintains a concise, highly technical CLI catalog (~150 "
"entries) containing Python brace placeholders (`{path}`, `{count}`), "
"`printf` tokens (`%s`), Rich terminal markup (`[bold]`, `[/]`), and CLI "
"flags (`--format`, `--hidden`), alongside multi-language Sphinx "
"documentation catalogs under `docs/source/locale/`. We must choose "
"between two primary localization architectures:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/localization_platforms.md:100
#: ec34c8da8c0548549024f763f797ecef
msgid ""
"**Option A (Local Open-Source CLI Automation + Git PRs):** Use "
"`tools/i18n.py` (`extract`, `translate`, `validate`, `compile`, `status`)"
" backed by `polib`, `babel`, and deterministic LLM batch translation "
"(`tools/i18n_translate.py`), with all review and auditing conducted via "
"GitHub Pull Requests and CI gates."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/localization_platforms.md:104
#: b232be2dc6bf41299105a462ef723f25
msgid ""
"**Option B (Managed Cloud Localization Platform with Bidirectional GitHub"
" Sync):** Adopt a hosted platform (Crowdin, POEditor, or Localazy) as the"
" primary translation hub synchronized to GitHub via webhooks or GitHub "
"Actions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/localization_platforms.md:108
#: 210a6a890e0b428a826cc2cb8e0201c7
msgid "Decision"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/localization_platforms.md:110
#: babe693185a8465582a8a5572c4196f2
msgid ""
"We select **Option A: Fully local, open-source CLI automation via "
"`tools/i18n.py translate` + Git Pull Requests** as `findfmt`'s "
"authoritative localization architecture."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/localization_platforms.md:113
#: 87542830e3864b43a366ec7358c377cf
msgid "Rationale"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/localization_platforms.md:115
#: b1db4c07c3054c58ba9a9aa64b731929
#, python-brace-format, python-format
msgid ""
"**Strict Structural Validation:** `tools/i18n_validation.py` enforces "
"`findfmt`-specific invariants (Rich `[bold]`/`[/]` markup parity, "
"`{brace}` and `%s` placeholder sets, `ngettext` plural array counts "
"across `nplurals=1..6`, and relative `#:` location paths) both during LLM"
" generation and in pre-commit/CI."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/localization_platforms.md:119
#: a5e14d16526c4a8786e677a1b27ab5cd
msgid ""
"**Single Source of Truth & Zero Lock-In:** Keeping `.pot` templates, "
"`.po` catalogs, domain glossaries (`tools/i18n_prompts.py`), and "
"validation logic inside the Git repository eliminates bidirectional sync "
"conflicts and external SaaS dependencies."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/localization_platforms.md:122
#: f0a5c339d07743acb0e2c12c2034befe
msgid ""
"**Negligible Cost & Offline Reproducibility:** Translating the entire "
